/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Defense-in-depth for tools/ndk_verify.py: the official Amiga NDK carries
# no redistribution license (see docs/plan.md and that script's module
# doc), so it must never be vendored into this repo. `ndk_verify.py`
# itself also refuses to run against a path inside the repo tree, but
# these patterns are ignored too in case a copy ever lands here by
# accident.
/ndk/
/NDK/
*.lha
